      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPresenting No. 47 Exchange Hall.\n\nThis one bedroom apartment comes to the market in good condition throughout having been recently painted, boasting a very spacious living area and fully fitted kitchen.\n\nThe development benefits from its close proximity to all amenities from resturants and pubs to shops and buses - the list is endless, this particular apartment has no onward chain so perfect for all types of buyers.\n\nAlso within short walking distance is LUAS, Tallaght Stadium, Sean Walsh Memorial Park and Tallaght Hospital. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises living/dining area, balcony, kitchen, one double bedroom and family bathroom. \n\nThis property also majorly benefits from having no onward chain making it suitable to any type of buyer.\n\nCall or email for viewing details."
      },
